      "id": "2026-10-28-luma-qewnqhas",
      "kind": "event",
      "source": "https://luma.com/qewnqhas",
      "event": {
        "slug": "ground-truth-mumbai",
        "description": "A Devcon 8 side event in Mumbai (BKC). It is separate from Devcon, so no Devcon ticket is needed. A networking dinner on queryable onchain data, prediction markets, agent infrastructure and onchain justice, co-hosted by Kleros with Arkiv Network (by Golem Network) and Web3 Mumbai. Programme (IST): doors open at 18:00, the three hosts give a welcome toast at 18:45, and at 19:00 Kleros and Arkiv hold a fireside chat, \"Truth for Machines: Who keeps the record, who settles the dispute?\", on how agents and markets share data, build identity and reputation, and resolve disputes. Dinner and open networking follow at 19:30, the results of the evening's prediction market are announced at 21:15, and the event closes at 22:00. Free to attend; the hosts approve registrations. Wei Wei Ooi is a Luma co-host."
      }
    },
